---@field publisherIds? gcp.realtimebidding_v1.StringList A list of publisher IDs to target in the pretargeting configuration. These values will be added to the list of targeted publisher IDs in PretargetingConfig.publisherTargeting.values. Publishers are identified by their publisher ID from ads.txt / app-ads.txt. See https://iabtechlab.com/ads-txt/ and https://iabtechlab.com/app-ads-txt/ for more details.
