---@field urlRestriction? gcp.realtimebidding_v1.UrlRestriction Required. Deprecated. This will be removed in October 2023. For more information, see the release notes: https://developers.google.com/authorized-buyers/apis/relnotes#real-time-bidding-api The URL restriction for the user list.
