---Video content for a creative.
---@class gcp.realtimebidding_v1.VideoContent
---@field videoMetadata? gcp.realtimebidding_v1.VideoMetadata Output only. Video metadata.
---@field videoUrl? string The URL to fetch a video ad. The URL should return an XML response that conforms to the VAST 2.0, 3.0 or 4.x standard.
---@field videoVastXml? string The contents of a VAST document for a video ad. This document should conform to the VAST 2.0, 3.0, or 4.x standard.

---Video metadata for a creative.
---@class gcp.realtimebidding_v1.VideoMetadata
---@field duration? string The duration of the ad. Can be used to filter the response of the creatives.list method.
---@field vastVersion? gcp.realtimebidding_v1.VideoMetadataVastVersionEnum|string The maximum VAST version across all wrapped VAST documents. Can be used to filter the response of the creatives.list method.
---@field skipOffset? string The minimum duration that the user has to watch before being able to skip this ad. If the field is not set, the ad is not skippable. If the field is set, the ad is skippable. Can be used to filter the response of the creatives.list method.
---@field isValidVast? boolean Is this a valid VAST ad? Can be used to filter the response of the creatives.list method.
---@field isVpaid? boolean Is this a VPAID ad? Can be used to filter the response of the creatives.list method.
---@field mediaFiles? gcp.realtimebidding_v1.MediaFileList The list of all media files declared in the VAST. If there are multiple VASTs in a wrapper chain, this includes the media files from the deepest one in the chain.

---@alias gcp.realtimebidding_v1.VideoMetadataVastVersionEnum "VAST_VERSION_UNSPECIFIED"|"VAST_VERSION_1_0"|"VAST_VERSION_2_0"|"VAST_VERSION_3_0"|"VAST_VERSION_4_0"

---@class gcp.realtimebidding_v1.WatchBiddersCreativesRequest
---@field parent string Required. To watch all creatives pertaining to the bidder and all its child seat accounts, the bidder must follow the pattern `bidders/{bidderAccountId}`.
---@field body? gcp.realtimebidding_v1.WatchCreativesRequest Request body

---A request to receive push notifications when any of the creatives belonging to the bidder changes status.
---@class gcp.realtimebidding_v1.WatchCreativesRequest

---A response for the request to receive push notification when a bidder's creatives change status.
---@class gcp.realtimebidding_v1.WatchCreativesResponse
---@field subscription? string The Pub/Sub subscription that can be used to pull creative status notifications. This would be of the format `projects/{project_id}/subscriptions/{subscription_id}`. Subscription is created with pull delivery. All service accounts belonging to the bidder will have read access to this subscription. Subscriptions that are inactive for more than 90 days will be disabled. Use watchCreatives to re-enable the subscription.
---@field topic? string The Pub/Sub topic that will be used to publish creative serving status notifications. This would be of the format `projects/{project_id}/topics/{topic_id}`.

